// Title: selectionWatcher stream definition (KScript), text box follows the selected Box's name
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Section 1 (KSWorld bubble example), code listing
//         after "Then we add the following stream to make the text field update according to the selected Box's name";
//         PDF page 9 (printed page 8).
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.
selectionWatcher <-
  when
    DocEditor.selectedDocBox :b
  then
    this.textContents(if b then b.printString() else "")

// Transcription notes
// - The text layer and the page image agree on every line.
// - Indentation (2-space steps) reproduced from the page image; exact space counts may differ.
// - The listing sits in a monospace block; the prose after it ("where the virtual field DocEditor ...")
//   is not part of the listing.
